Detects a consistent body size across post requests to detect exfiltraion in cobalt strike


index="cobaltstrike_exfiltration_http" sourcetype="bro:http:json" method=POST
| streamstats current=f last(request_body_len) as prev_body_len by dest, src, dest_port
| eval request_body_len_delta = request_body_len - prev_body_len
| eventstats avg(request_body_len_delta) as avg, count as total by dest, src, dest_port
| where total > 10
| eval upper = avg*1.1
| eval lower = avg*0.9
| where request_body_len_delta >= lower AND request_body_len_delta <= upper
| stats count, values(avg) as len_between by dest, src, dest_port, total
| eval prcnt = (count / total) * 100
| where prcnt >= 90
